# A card at its dam's control panel: ItemAction_GreenCard (ps2.asm:14406)
# faced at index $1D, the Green Dam F1 panel (object $38 at 113,28, an
# invisible block with hit-box row 7). loc_9D70: bset #0 on event_flags
# + $1D ($C72D), `move.w #8, (event_flags).w`, $18 and the card removed;
# the next visit is $1B, "The dam locks open, and rushing water is
# heard.", with SXFID_DamOpened. Camera case 8 (loc_81E6) then finds the
# other three dams shut and clears event_flags: no battle. Before build
# 80 the port printed "the dam panel is not ported" and kept the card.
# The save is story_climatrol.json moved to 113,29.

start slot 1 routes/saves/green_dam_panel.json
wait idle
press c
wait idle
press c
wait idle
press c
wait idle
press c
wait idle
press c
wait screen level
wait idle
expect level $31 113 29
expect object $38 visible
give GreenCard 1             # Rudo's bag, slot 5
press up                     # face the panel
wait idle
press a
wait idle
expect script $171B          # ObjType_Events $1C-$23 (loc_DC9C)
press c
wait idle
press c                      # the C menu
wait idle
press c                      # ITEM
wait idle
press down
press c                      # RUDO
wait idle
press down
press down
press down
press down
press down                   # GREENCARD, slot 5
press c
wait idle
press c                      # USE
wait idle
expect script $0018          # "'Character' puts 'Item' inside."
expect flag $C72D 1
press c
wait idle
expect script $001B          # "The dam locks open..."
shot 01_dam_opened
press c
wait idle
expect screen level
expect flag $C72D 1
expect no-stderr not ported
